==Battleground==
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Happy 100 (Enemy)|Happy 100]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**8 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

